 this campaign. Additional tasks need to be fulfilled to earn rewards. These are:\u003cbr/\u003e\u003cbr/\u003e","waitinglist.terms.rule2":"\u003cstrong\u003e2. Event Period:\u003c/strong\u003e\u003cbr/\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eWaitlist Registration Period:\u003c/strong\u003e Eligible participants may join the KuCoin EU Waitlist Giveaway until 23:59:59 UTC on the day that KuCoin EU publicly announces its go-live. Applications to participate in the campaign received after this date will not be accepted.\u003cbr/\u003e\u003cbr/\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eTrading Period:\u003c/strong\u003e The eligible trading period will open at 00:00:00 UTC the day after KuCoin EU publicly announces its go-live. The trading period will close at 23:59:59 UTC on the 30th calendar day after the trading period begins. Trading volume accumulated outside of the trading period will not contribute to reward qualification.\u003cbr/\u003e\u003cbr/\u003e","copy.success":"Copied.","waitinglist.terms.rule3":"\u003cstrong\u003e3. How to Participate:\u003c/strong\u003e\u003cbr/\u003eStep 1: Enter your email on the KuCoin EU Waitlist Giveaway Page\u003cbr/\u003eStep 2: Click on the link in your confirmation email to navigate to the campaign page and confirm your participation\u003cbr/\u003eStep 3: Once account registration becomes available, create and verify your KuCoin EU account with the same email that you used to register for the KuCoin EU Waitlist Giveaway\u003cbr/\u003eStep 4: Deposit a minimum of 20 USDC (or an equivalent value in an alternate currency) to your account to qualify for the first reward\u003cbr/\u003eStep 5: Reach each Spot Trading threshold to claim the associated reward\u003cbr/\u003e\u003cbr/\u003eTo become a participant, you must enter your email on the KuCoin EU Waitlist Giveaway webpage before creating an account. Participants who successfully sign up for the KuCoin EU Waitlist Giveaway will receive a confirmation email.\u003cbr/\u003e\u003cbr/\u003e","648cbd84207b4000a693":"In Progress — EU Regulatory Alignment (GDPR \u0026 DORA)","KCEU.privacy.rule15.text":"\u003cdiv\u003eIn principle, you are not legally required to provide us with your Personal Data. However, the provision of certain Personal Data is necessary to access and use our Platform, to comply with statutory obligations (e.g. under anti-money laundering and counter-terrorism financing laws), or to enter into and perform a contract with us.\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv\u003eIn particular, we are legally obliged to collect and process specific categories of Personal Data (such as identification documents and proof of address) before entering into a business relationship, and on an ongoing basis, in accordance with applicable Know-Your-Customer (KYC) and Anti-Money Laundering (AML) requirements. \u003c/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv\u003eWithout this information, we cannot provide you with access to our Services or might not be able to establish or continue a business relationship with you, or to provide certain features of our Platform.\u003c/div\u003e","waitinglist.news.title":"Exciting News Ahead","waitinglist.terms.rule1":"These New Joiner Campaign Terms for the \"KuCoin EU Waitlist Giveaway\" supplement the KuCoin EU Campaign Agreement, which can be found \u003ca href=\"https://www.kucoin.com/en-eu/support/48142946142302\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"\u003ehere\u003c/a\u003e. By participating in this campaign, you accept both the campaign-specific terms and the general Campaign Agreement.\u003cbr/\u003e\u003cbr/\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e1. Participant Eligibility:\u003c/strong\u003e\u003cbr/\u003eThis New Joiner Campaign is open to persons who have not previously opened an account with KuCoin EU and who fulfill the onboarding and account requirements set out in Section 4 of the General Terms. You must have your place of residence in an EEA country (except for Malta) to be eligible to participate in this campaign.\u003cbr/\u003e\u003cbr/\u003eTo participate in this campaign, you must successfully create a KuCoin EU account and agree to these Campaign Terms and the Campaign Agreement.\u003cbr/\u003e\u003cbr/\u003eThis event is first-come, first-served, with the number of participants capped at 20,000.\u003cbr/\u003e\u003cbr/\u003e","648cbd84207b4000a691":"GDPR \u0026 DORA Compliance","e0b9b909d2814000ae22":"Complete Sign-Up","n7Eq12wrJ1EUZsZafBfqDj":"Assets","ppSJayPMSEtT4nmfgRobMb":"Apply to become a {brandName} Market Maker and enjoy up to 1.2bps (spot) / 1.5bps (futures) transaction commissions.","6haStyppdxWVmjMJACyHmF":"Does {brandName} provide API documentation?","waitinglist.terms.rule8":"\u003cstrong\u003e5. Additional Conditions:\u003c/strong\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003eParticipation in this campaign (by creating an account), completing tasks and receiving rewards, is subject to the full go-live of the KuCoin EU platform. KuCoin EU does not make any promises or guarantees regarding such a future go-live.\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eYou must complete the tasks within the campaign periods (as set in these Campaign Terms) to be able to receive rewards. Over-completion, such as trading additional volume or completing other tasks, does not grant you additional rewards.\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e","waitinglist.terms.rule9":"\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003eTo qualify for rewards once KuCoin EU account registration opens, eligible participants must:\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003eComplete full KYC and verification and deposit a minimum of 20 USDC or an equivalent amount in another supported fiat currency or crypto-asset to their account.\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eMeet one or more of the spot trading volume tiers to qualify for higher reward tiers.\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eAll previous campaign steps must be completed before the user is eligible to meet a higher reward tier.\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eEach eligible user may only create one account with KuCoin EU. Creating duplicate or fake accounts 