rmines the purposes and means of the processing of personal data.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e“\u003cbl\u003eSupervisory Authority\u003c/bl\u003e” refers to the Österreichische Datenschutzbehörde, Barichgasse 40-42, 1030 Vienna (T +43 1 52 152-0, M dsb@dsb.gv.at).\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e“\u003cbl\u003eData Subject\u003c/bl\u003e” means an identified or identifiable natural person. An identifiable natural person is one who can be identified, directly, or indirectly, by reference to an identifier, such as a name, an identification number, location data, an online identifier or to one or more factors specific to the physical, physiological, genetic, mental, economic, cultural, or social identity of that natural person.\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e","3f356c73fec24000a532":"Earn commissions based on referred client trading volume. Commissions may still apply when referrals trade at reduced or zero fees, subject to program rules.","ebxFDd617NJtkZk1a6GmPY":"Your Safe and Trusted Crypto Exchange","1gVVFbkbS9n7oz8557DTaT":"Public Data","26d54e9f99024800a572":"Is {brandName} safe?","dDobtrcV32gRrfF4emAcCv":"1. Log in to your {brandName} account, then click the user icon in the upper right corner.","5bd72f1707874800a2a2":"Yes, {brandName} is legit, secure, and globally recognized as one of the leading crypto exchanges for both beginners and professional traders.","fdefb246134b4800a171":"What is the best app to buy crypto?","api.chooseReason.keyManagement.title":"One-Click Key Management","c9PPUBFA7Uwf5bafjZsxzT":"Deposit Method","0278a315709a4800a78a":"(1d)","1oJKWCTYcn4tPQGBPZeRHK":"Reviewing","9f7045f82efd4800a835":"For API-related questions, please \u003ca target='_blank' rel='noopener noreferrer' href='{url1}'\u003eemail us\u003c/a\u003e us or join our \u003ca target='_blank' rel='noopener noreferrer' href='{url2}'\u003eofficial API support community\u003c/a\u003e for assistance.","5200ae88b39b4800aa49":"New here? We've got you covered.","e6a12e834b8d4800af14":"N